  <History Date="08-03-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="10-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed power on and locate.  Added Red,Green,Blue and replaced in single-cell modes." />
  <History Date="10-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added v-dim.  Added palettes.  Added pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="18-08-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Simplified shutter.  Changed macro to effect group to match wheel slot." />
  <History Date="18-08-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed multi-cell dimmer links.  Fixed 4 DMX mode (was using RGB1)" />
  <History Date="03-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="03-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Changed name from LB-12T to LB12T" />
